---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import {cases,url,caseUrl,demoUrl,imageUrl,labels,playable,prompt,repository} from '../../lib/catalog.mjs';
export function getStaticPaths(){return cases.flatMap(c=>[c.id,...(c.legacyIds||[])].map(id=>({params:{id},props:{c}})));}
const {c}=Astro.props;const text=await prompt(c);
if(Astro.params.id!==c.id)return Astro.redirect(caseUrl(c),301);
---
<Layout title={`${c.title} · 造物集`} description={c.description} image={c.cover?imageUrl(c):undefined}>
<div class="page"><div class="breadcrumb"><a href={url('')}>作品集</a><span>/</span><a href={url('')+'?topic='+c.topic}>{c.topicLabel}</a><span>/</span><span>运行记录</span></div>
<div class="detail-top"><div><p class="eyebrow">{c.topicLabel} / {c.harness}</p><h1 class="page-title">{c.title}</h1><p class="page-lead">{c.description}</p></div><div class="actions">{playable(c)&&<a class="button dark" href={demoUrl(c)} target="_blank" rel="noopener">独立打开作品 ↗</a>}<a class="button" href={`${repository}/tree/main/cases/${c.id}/source`} target="_blank" rel="noopener">查看源码 ↗</a></div></div>
{c.cover?<img class="detail-hero" src={imageUrl(c)} alt={c.title+'的实际场景截图'} width="1500" height="900"/>:<div class="detail-hero no-cover"><span>本次运行仅留有材料</span><small>{c.notes[0]||'尚无可展示的画面'}</small></div>}
<div class="detail-layout"><div class="detail-main"><section class="experience"><h2>走进这个世界</h2>{playable(c)?<><p>{c.controls}</p><p>点击后加载原始作品。桌面浏览器通常能获得更完整的体验。</p><div class="actions"><button class="button dark" id="load-demo" data-src={demoUrl(c)}>在本页体验 ↗</button><a class="button" href={demoUrl(c)} target="_blank" rel="noopener">新窗口打开 ↗</a></div><iframe id="demo-frame" title={c.title+'在线体验'} class="experience-frame" hidden allow="fullscreen; autoplay" allowfullscreen></iframe></>:<div class="frame-placeholder">{c.adapter==='materials'?'本次运行没有可发布的完整作品，已有任务与材料仍然保留。':'当前版本未通过展示验证，保留源码与问题记录供回看。'}</div>}</section>
<section class="notes"><h2>这次运行的记录</h2>{c.provenance?.url&&<p>恢复来源：<a href={c.provenance.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener">原始 PR ↗</a> · 提交 <code>{c.provenance.commit.slice(0,12)}</code></p>}<ul>{c.notes.map(n=><li>{n}</li>)}</ul>{c.verification&&<p style="margin-top:15px">发布验证：{c.verification.date}。{c.verification.summary}</p>}</section>
<section class="prompt-section"><div class="prompt-heading"><h2>提示词</h2>{text&&<button class="button" id="copy-prompt">复制原文</button>}</div>{text?<>{c.promptSource&&<p>标准任务原文来源：<a href={c.promptSource.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Nagi Bench ↗</a> · {c.promptSource.license}。用户已确认当时使用 Nagi 标准任务原文。</p>}<p class="prompt-preview">{text.slice(0,250)}{text.length>250?'…':''}</p><details class="prompt-detail"><summary>展开完整提示词 · {text.length.toLocaleString()} 字符</summary><pre class="prompt-text" id="prompt-text">{text}</pre></details><a class="prompt-download" href={url('generated/prompts/'+c.id+'.md')} download={c.id+'-prompt.md'}>下载原始提示词 ↓</a><span id="copy-status" class="copy-status" role="status"></span></>:<p>没有找到这份产物实际使用的提示词。这里保留缺失状态，未用相似任务补写。</p>}</section>
{c.gallery.length>0&&<section class="screenshots"><h2>更多画面</h2><div class="shot-grid">{c.gallery.map((name,i)=><a href={imageUrl(c,name)} target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src={imageUrl(c,name)} alt={`${c.title} · 画面 ${i+1}`} width="1600" height="1000" loading="lazy"/></a>)}</div></section>}
</div><aside class="side-panel"><h2>生成条件</h2><dl class="metadata"><div><dt>模型 / 标识</dt><dd>{c.model}</dd></div><div><dt>Harness</dt><dd>{c.harness}</dd></div><div><dt>提示词版本</dt><dd>{c.promptHash?c.promptVariant:'未记录'}</dd></div>{c.effort&&<div><dt>思考强度</dt><dd>{c.effort}</dd></div>}<div><dt>案例编号</dt><dd><code>{c.id}</code></dd></div><div><dt>运行日期</dt><dd>{c.date||'未记录'}</dd></div><div><dt>展示状态</dt><dd>{labels[c.status]}</dd></div><div><dt>模型归属依据</dt><dd>{c.modelEvidence}</dd></div><div><dt>提示词指纹</dt><dd>{c.promptHash?c.promptHash.slice(0,16):'未记录'}</dd></div></dl><p class="side-note">“已验证展示”表示当前发布版本能够加载并显示场景。玩法深度、美术质量和需求完成度仍需具体观察。</p><a class="prompt-download" href={`${repository}/tree/main/cases/${c.id}`} target="_blank" rel="noopener">完整案例材料 ↗</a></aside></div>
</div>
<script>
document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('#load-demo')?.addEventListener('click',function(){const f=document.querySelector<HTMLIFrameElement>('#demo-frame')!;f.src=this.dataset.src!;f.hidden=false;this.hidden=true;f.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});});
document.querySelector('#copy-prompt')?.addEventListener('click',async()=>{const text=document.querySelector('#prompt-text')?.textContent||'';const status=document.querySelector('#copy-status')!;try{await navigator.clipboard.writeText(text);status.textContent=' 已复制';}catch{status.textContent=' 复制未成功，可展开后选择原文或下载';}});
</script>
</Layout>
